__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# Runtime-seeded config (copied from provided/ on first boot by seed_if_missing —
# see D-014). data/run.jsonl is intentionally NOT listed here: it is a
# committed, tracked Day 1 artifact, not a runtime-generated file.
data/servers.json
data/requests.csv

# Bonus (Day 3A) run-context sidecar — optional runtime metadata from the
# evaluator/artifact perspective (never a required deliverable, never
# seeded), so it's ignored like the other runtime files above. Its own
# publication is not uniformly best-effort, though: the pending-marker write
# is a mandatory prerequisite for publishing a new trace (a failure there
# aborts the run before any new run.jsonl is written); only the final
# complete-context write, after the trace has already been published
# successfully, is best-effort. See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §27. data/run.jsonl
# itself remains intentionally NOT listed here.
data/run_context.json
